<ansi fg="black-bold">.:</ansi> <ansi fg="magenta">Help for </ansi><ansi fg="command">psychic-anchor</ansi> spell

The <ansi fg="command">Psychic Anchor</ansi> spell drives a psionic anchor into the target's
consciousness, rooting their mind to the present location and severing
their ability to move or teleport away. An anchored target cannot
flee or escape through magical means.

<ansi fg="yellow">Usage: </ansi>

  <ansi fg="command">cast psychic-anchor [target]</ansi>

<ansi fg="yellow">Details: </ansi>

  <ansi fg="yellow">Type:        </ansi> Harm Single
  <ansi fg="yellow">School:      </ansi> Mental
  <ansi fg="yellow">Base Folds:  </ansi> 8
  <ansi fg="yellow">Conv. Cost:  </ansi> 60
  <ansi fg="yellow">Defense:     </ansi> Mental — willpower resists the anchoring
  <ansi fg="yellow">Effect:      </ansi> Immobilizes the target, preventing movement or teleport

<ansi fg="magenta-bold">See also:</ansi> <ansi fg="command">help spells</ansi>, <ansi fg="command">help cast</ansi>
